  "title": "Ph Insurance Faqs Objections — Section 7",
  "content": "### FAQ 5: What are the perks of getting a policy through Bancassurance bank referral?\n- **Answer**: If you are referred by or hold an account with our partner banks (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, or Security Bank), you qualify for express non-medical underwriting up to ₱3,000,000 face amount, hassle-free automated auto-debit arrangement (ADA), and a 5% first-year premium rebate.\n\n---",
